              "name": "Rec 3",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "3. menu bar 每秒重畫，改設定馬上看到結果，所以設定視窗不用再做預覽，程式最少。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
